<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 14.85pt 0pt 11.3pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_90B_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260617__20260617_zKoAfdFp14el"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-06-17" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000026" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

